[{"title":"绯桃","author":"屈大均","text":"炎方隔岁已春华，每恨花朝不见花。\n多谢绯桃情意好，清明开向野人家。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13787,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"新竹","author":"屈大均","text":"烟梢露叶碧蒙茸，迸出新林尽箨龙。\n青玉雨馀春粉少，楚辞多写墨香浓。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13788,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"水仙","author":"屈大均","text":"天暖水仙花不香，天寒香始满兰房。\n生来姿性宜冰雪，却笑梅花冻欲僵。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13789,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"柳 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"青青一夕已成丝，舞向东风不自持。\n白首正愁飞絮乱，莫教如雪一枝枝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13790,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"柳 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"一丝一缕已风流，半拂芳塘半画楼。\n日夕含烟复含雨，不将春色散人愁。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13791,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"柳 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"故作长条要拂人，莫教攀折向芳春。\n怜他叶底流莺好，掩映双栖不露身。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13792,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"柳 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"已遣飞花作白蘋，又教吹絮逐香茵。\n枝间娇鸟纷无数，第一流莺最恼人。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13793,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"留雁 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"未到花朝已北飞，江南春色苦相违。\n哀笳一片风沙外，家在阴山讵忍归。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13794,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"留雁 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"江南亦未稻粱稀，菰米香分塞马肥。\n春暖汀洲芳草里，无人惊起一行飞。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13795,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"一春","author":"屈大均","text":"一春寒卧拥香篝，每恨东风吹满楼。\n故遣垂杨与垂柳，千丝万缕搅人愁。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13796,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"今岁","author":"屈大均","text":"今岁莺花倍觉稀，春寒不肯作芳菲。\n萋萋但长天山草，祗恐边人马不肥。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13797,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"春尽 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"清明正是最愁时，泪作空濛细雨丝。\n春色欲寻无处所，莺花不遣恨人知。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13798,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"春尽 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"细雨春山乱出泉，愁随流水日涓涓。\n泪痕留与青青草，半作棠梨半杜鹃。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13799,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"春尽 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"一夕春归失丽华，无多蛱蝶扑晴沙。\n红馀杜宇无非血，白到棠梨不是花。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13800,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"春迟","author":"屈大均","text":"今年春早却春迟，冻死莺花春不知。\n凄绝清明纷雨雪，苦寒如在雁门时。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13801,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"巫山 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"巫山亦有望夫台，神女何年化石来。\n一自襄王魂梦接，至今云雨不曾开。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13802,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"巫山 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"一峰终古一相思，绝似哀猿无尽时。\n神女风流在何处，芙蓉十二是蛾眉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13803,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"香溪","author":"屈大均","text":"香溪有女旧如花，定是巫峰一朵霞。\n谁分琵琶弹马上，空留哀怨满龙沙。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13804,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杜鹃花 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"栈阁连云百道斜，猿声处处接三巴。\n无多望帝春魂在，半作啼鹃半作花。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13805,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杜鹃花 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"春魂多少在蚕丛，化作山花踯躅红。\n朵朵知含亡国恨，无情亦与子鹃同。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13806,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杜鹃花 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"豹汝多情又作花，枝枝古血似残霞。\n春归乱向鱼凫落，绝似飘零帝子家。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13807,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"杜鹃花 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"开处千山万壑香，一花一叶是君王。\n心伤野死重瞳似，再拜春丛涕泪长。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13808,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题胡君浣花图","author":"屈大均","text":"松身伛偻文人同，怪石还如一老公。\n手把素书人尚少，未应频作浣花翁。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13809,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"友人言石?水帘为丰湖之源率题二绝 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"一帘飞作一湖来，湖阔珠玑撒不开。\n玉女九天纷咳唾，随风又化瀑花回。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13810,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"友人言石?水帘为丰湖之源率题二绝 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"每恨珠帘捲太高，天风忽作快并刀。\n剪将半幅为秋雨，散入双湖起雪涛。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13811,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"几日浮生已作翁，依稀屯难记相同。\n静江宫府多遗事，一笑兴亡似转蓬。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13812,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"黄门未老竟抽簪，清绝罗浮访道心。\n此处丹砂依旧少，仍从勾漏洞中寻。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13813,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"昭江西上片帆飞，相送津亭当夕晖。\n惆怅漓南与湘北，无穷杨柳共依依。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13814,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"都峤联绵似九疑，重华遗迹少人知。\n梧州斑管君多取，为写青莲古别离。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13815,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"三江春涨一江同，金谷佳人庙貌东。\n吾过定闻吹玉笛，月明环佩挟翔风。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13816,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"故园风物趁春华，归及昭平即见家。\n僮女正薰临贺笋，畲人初制富川茶。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13817,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其七","author":"屈大均","text":"徭洞绵蛮语不真，竹枝多作与茶人。\n西瓯士俗工歌唱，莫向花前听入神。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13818,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其八","author":"屈大均","text":"漓山漓水苦多滩，鱼逆惊流取不难。\n无数鸬鹚乘雨放，君钩不用下琅玕。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13819,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其九","author":"屈大均","text":"桂林一水牵罗带，阳朔千峰削玉簪。\n君爱玲珑多洞穴，山山应作读书龛。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13820,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其十","author":"屈大均","text":"犀角先尝四月红，青黄相杂未冰融。\n留君少住看全熟，夏至千林火齐同。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13821,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其十一","author":"屈大均","text":"勾粤东西总故乡，乘流三日即羚羊。\n嘉鱼十月冲寒出，来系兰桡大小湘。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13822,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送袁休庵通政 其十二","author":"屈大均","text":"建陵春酿更多携，桂酒名将寄酒齐。\n明岁故人如健在，玉壶先到越台西。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13823,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"汉口曲 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"大别如城绕汉阳，南流汉水入江长。\n朝朝夏口开帆席，黄鹄招人过武昌。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13824,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"汉口曲 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"南岸花连北岸香，前湖风接后湖凉。\n生憎大别中央出，江汉分流两道长。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13825,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"永州南望苍梧作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"三湘清绝是潇湘，南接苍梧九水长。\n此地重华知最爱，故教埋玉九疑阳。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13826,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"永州南望苍梧作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"二妃愁思满零陵，竹上啼痕总不冰。\n青鸟未陪梧野葬，文鱼空向洞庭乘。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13827,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"湘中闻竹枝","author":"屈大均","text":"竹枝本是三巴曲，流入湖湘调更悲。\n风俗变来从屈宋，千秋哀怨一相思。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13828,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"合江亭作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"雨过蒸湘似倒流，合江亭与水光浮。\n云从石鼓过回雁，共作衡阳一片秋。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13829,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"合江亭作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"衡州地势曲如弓，一道蒸湘射碧空。\n岳影远随湘水去，人湖分作万芙蓉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13830,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送陆鍊师","author":"屈大均","text":"湖口西行上九江，香炉烟气引飞幢。\n心随一片秋天月，出入云中玉女窗。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13831,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"自大小王公岭经枫林桥一路丹枫古木与梅桂相乱坡陀高低石路坦洁绝可爱","author":"屈大均","text":"车随石路去迢迢，夹岸枫林隐一桥。\n松树不知何处尽，人穿苍翠已三朝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13832,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"君山夜泊","author":"屈大均","text":"相思七十二峰青，云引愁心过洞庭。\n采罢芙蓉秋月下，回舟何处吊湘灵。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13833,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日庐山作寄缪天自","author":"屈大均","text":"一啸霜林叶尽飞，白云终古独无依。\n山中五老长相待，何事秋深尚不归。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13834,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题某禅师空生阁 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"黄岩瀑布甲庐山，岩上空生阁一间。\n茅厚不愁冰雪压，围炉相对一冬閒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13835,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题某禅师空生阁 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"鹤鸣双剑两峰开，争倒晴川布水台。\n马尾谷帘那得似，因君挥麈故飞来。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13836,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"青玉峡","author":"屈大均","text":"冰开瀑布落成溪，千丈飞丝马尾齐。\n青玉峡中行不得，朝猿啼罢暮猿啼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13837,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"陈宫辞 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"玉树新歌唱未终，石头城外战云红。\n君王失国风流甚，笑抱名妃入井中。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13838,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"陈宫辞 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"古寺虚无玉殿存，美人环佩响黄昏。\n多情最是萋萋草，不没胭脂井上痕。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13839,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"陈宫辞 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"临春结绮彩云间，天上张星玉作颜。\n万岁不愁歌舞尽，龙蟠虎踞是钟山。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13840,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"正学祠下作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"正学祠堂冷不扃，忠魂千古哭山灵。\n兴王一姓犹甘死，管魏能无污汗青。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13841,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"正学祠下作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"一介忠臣十族殃，兴朝元气黯然伤。\n宁王何事无惭德，坐见夷齐死首阳。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13842,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"玉溆金塘雨过时，家家杨柳映茅茨。\n溪行忽与人烟远，一树梅花独自知。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13843,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"江南无路草萋萋，欲送王孙烟雨迷。\n几度兰舟行不得，鹧鸪偏向夕阳啼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13844,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"草长陈宫日已非，春魂化燕欲何归。\n分明记得秦淮上，一路梅花照翠微。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13845,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"松竹阴寒欲雨天，南朝古寺暮钟连。\n山僧不记谁家腊，依旧楼台甲子年。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13846,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"歌舞销沉一夜风，繁华自古送英雄。\n可怜七曲江南弄，都入胡笳惨淡中。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13847,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"棠梨花落子规啼，望断荆门烟雨迷。\n一叶渔舟君可渡，晴云犹在洞庭西。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13848,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其七","author":"屈大均","text":"日斜湖上听歌还，落尽夭桃惨客颜。\n回首白门杨柳外，春风一半在寒山。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13849,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其八","author":"屈大均","text":"登台休更怆寒烟，岂有山河与赫连。\n闻道燕支黄叶早，行人归及未秋天。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13850,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其九","author":"屈大均","text":"燕子新笺唱未终，君臣一笑失江东。\n风吹苑柳花无数，飞向天山与雪同。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13851,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其十","author":"屈大均","text":"留得江山一片秋，可怜失国尽风流。\n凄凉更有金川事，烟草兼含六代愁。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13852,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其十一","author":"屈大均","text":"日落中原虎豹骄，乾坤无力捍南朝。\n谁教一代衣冠尽，白骨青苔镇寂寥。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13853,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其十二","author":"屈大均","text":"香车白马簇城隅，烟雨春光乍有无。\n多少酒旗歌板处，游人偏向莫愁湖。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13854,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其十三","author":"屈大均","text":"烟雨春光澹欲无，年年愁满莫愁湖。\n清明莫向江南过，芳草萋萋是故都。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13855,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其十四","author":"屈大均","text":"榆柳青青万井烟，游人隔袖揖金鞭。\n桃花不解王孙恨，开遍燕姬酒肆边。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13856,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其十五","author":"屈大均","text":"江左衣冠久已倾，看花谁问凤凰城。\n年年此地逢寒食，歌罢龙蛇泪满缨。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13857,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秣陵春望有作 其十六","author":"屈大均","text":"凄凉今古一荒丘，欲问沧桑水自流。\n归去东樵高卧好，青山犹为野人留。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13858,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秦淮曲中词 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"沙喜何如沙嫩清，日将纨扇写黄庭。\n东华园里閒飞鞚，身似穿花紫燕轻。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13859,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秦淮曲中词 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"青溪一曲接秦淮，旧院楼台满水涯。\n妓女湘兰称第一，怜才绝不似裙钗。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":13860,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}}]